<title>SWITZERLAND: SKI-JUMPING-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SKI-JUMPING-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ENGELBERG, Switzerland 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of a</p>
<p>World Cup ski jumping event on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Primoz Peterka (Slovenia) 252.90 points (first jump 125.00</p>
<p>metres, second jump 125.50 metres)</p>
<p>2. Janne Ahonen (Finland) 241.20 (124.00/125.00)</p>
<p>3. Jani Soininen (Finland) 238.30 (125.00/126.00)</p>
<p>4. Dieter Thoma (Germany) 228.00 (114.50/123.00)</p>
<p>5. Hiroya Saitoh (Japan) 225.70 (119.00/117.50)</p>
<p>6. Christoph Duffner (Germany) 224.40 (119.00/116.50)</p>
<p>7. Mika Laitinen (Finland) 224.20 (118.50/118.00)</p>
<p>8. Jerome Gay (France) 213.70 (116.50/112.50)</p>
<p>9. Andreas Goldberger (Austria) 202.40 (112.00/111.00)</p>
